[[2,1,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Raise the vehicle.</p><p>1. Unscrew bolts (1a) and remove the under-engine guard (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169000738.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the under-engine guard and tighten the bolts.</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]